What are the security risks associated with  storing passwords in plain text in node js ?
========================================================================
→If any user or admin has direct access to the database, they can see passwords if they are stored in plain text and may misuse those credentials and mostly people use the same passwords for multiple accounts for easy remember.
→ For security reasons, we should never store passwords directly.
→Instead, we store passwords using secure hashing algorithms, so even if someone accesses the database, they cannot read the original password.